      "content": "The policy identity is committed without binding it to the snapshot that was validated. Initialization of an existing workspace does not hold the lifecycle lock, and observation saves do not use that lock either. If a tab still using the previous policy adds an observation after this scan but before this commit, a newly excluded key can be missing from the receipt; subsequent launches skip validation because the stored identity already matches. Read metadata and observations in one snapshot, check its content revision (and previous identity) in the commit, and retry validation on conflict rather than reporting the policy as recorded.",
